<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <title>Game statistics</title>
		<link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet">
		<script type="text/javascript" src="statistics.js"></script>
    </head>
    <body>
		<div class="site-masthead">Games played</div>
		<nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary">
			<a class="site-nav-link" href="games-played.html">Games list</a>
			<a class="site-nav-link site-nav-link-active" href="statistics.html" aria-current="page">Statistics</a>
		</nav>
		<div class="centered stats-page">
		<div>
			<p>Various statistics about the games I've played, because statistics are fun.</p>
		</div>
			<div class="table-wrap">
				<h3>Timeline</h3>
				<p>When selecting "By played year", 1995 gets special handling because it's where I added old games with inaccurate dates.</p>
				<div class="chart-wrap">
					REPLACE_YEARLY_DYNAMIC
				</div>
				<h3>Played year × genre heatmap</h3>
				<div class="chart-wrap">
					REPLACE_PLAYED_GENRE_HEATMAP
				</div>
				<h3>Summary tables</h3>
				<h4>By platform</h4>
				<table class="stats-table">
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th>Platform</th>
							<th>Count</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						REPLACE_PLATFORM_ROWS
					</tbody>
				</table>
				<h4>By genre</h4>
			<table class="stats-table">
				<thead>
					<tr>
						<th>Genre</th>
						<th>Count</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					REPLACE_GENRE_ROWS
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>
	<footer class="site-footer">Games played list by <a href="https://jessekaukonen.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jesse Kaukonen</a> | <a href="https://github.com/SirDifferential/games-played" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source code on github</a></footer>
    </body>
</html>
